<title>JORDAN: Jordan seeks 150,000 T wheat on Oct 15 -trade.</title>
<headline>Jordan seeks 150,000 T wheat on Oct 15 -trade.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jordan announced on Thursday a snap tender to buy 150,000 tonnes of U.S. hard red winter wheat, traders said.</p>
<p>The shipment is to be delivered in three lots of 50,000 tonnes each in November, December and January.</p>
<p>The ministry set October 15 as a deadline for bids.</p>
<p>--Suleiman al-Khalidi, Amman Newsroom +9626-623776</p>
